OL,3,AHundreds of jobs under threat at
OL,4,AGrangemouth chemical plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Economy Secretary, Stephen Flynn,
OL,7,Fdescribed the plans as "extremely
OL,8,Fdisappointing".
